7.12 Find Related Replications
function findRelatedReplications(replicationId, auth):

Step 1. validateAuth(auth, "reader"). If not authorized, return an error.

Step 2. replication = selectReplication(replicationId). If null, return an error.

Step 3. sameClaim = selectReplicationsByClaim(replication.original_claim_id). sameField = selectReplicationsByField(replication.field).

Step 4. related = sameClaim excluding the current one. relatedField = sameField excluding the same claim and the current one.

Step 5. return the same_claim and same_field lists.

